    "title": "Rhode Island Emergency Management Agency responds to national alert system cybersecurity incident - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gino DeAngelis ,\n8 hours ago PROVIDENCE, R.I. (WLNE) — The Rhode Island Emergency Management Agency said a national cybersecurity incident targeted the OnSolve CodeRED emergency notification platform. RIEMA said that the incident did not result in the loss of the ability to alert the public because the agency uses additional alert and warning systems. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
